{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14126","headline":"谪官辰州冬至日[有]怀 · 戎昱","name":"谪官辰州冬至日[有]怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年长至在长安，策杖曾簪獬豸冠。\n此岁长安逢至日，下堦遥想雪霜寒。\n梦随行伍朝天去，身寄穷荒报国难。\n北望南郊消息断，江头唯有泪阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}